      "id": "merge-character-and-space-indices",
      "title": "字符流与空格下标归并",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "一次扫描同步消费插入位置数组。",
      "steps": [
        "builder、nextSpace=0",
        "i 遍历 s",
        "若 nextSpace<spaces.length 且 spaces[nextSpace]==i，追加空格并 nextSpace++；再追加 s[i]"
      ],
